config BR2_PACKAGE_COREROUTER_INSTALLER
	bool "corerouter-installer"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_COREROUTER
	help
	  The installer's kernel (G1.6c): the image's kernel source and
	  configuration with its own built-in command line, no BTF, and
	  an initramfs with corerouter-init (installer mode) and the
	  image keys. Boots from the ISO's El Torito/ESP image as
	  EFI/BOOT/BOOTX64.EFI.
